# ── Image size is the memory bill (2026-09-03) ───────────────────────────────
# A container's page cache counts toward Railway's memory charge, and the whole
# image gets written to the overlay filesystem at startup. Production was billed
# 2,062 MB of page cache — 2,036 MB of it `inactive_file`, read once and never
# referenced — against a 2.2 GB /app. Every MB shipped here is a MB billed for
# the life of the container, and production redeploys rarely.
#
# Nothing excluded below is read at build OR runtime. The parts of these trees
# that ARE read stay in the image — note the exclusions are deliberately narrow
# rather than whole-tree:
#   - scripts/lib/          — required by server/lib/failureLog.js and
#                             server/lib/storyMetrics.js (chTime)
#   - scripts/prerender.mjs — the build's prerender step
#     (only scripts/analysis and scripts/ads are excluded, not scripts/)
#   - docs/story-ideas      — read by server/lib/swissStories.js:65, so it is
#                             negated back in after the docs exclusion
# Verify with a grep for the path before adding anything here.

# 364 MB of committed test OUTPUT artifacts (tests/_outputs 151 MB,
# tests/tell-curated 68 MB, tests/trial 21 MB, composite + char-repair dirs).
tests

# 16 MB, of which docs/tests alone is 10 MB. story-ideas is the one part the
# server reads at runtime.
docs
!docs/story-ideas

# 57 MB of analysis output and 11 MB of ads tooling; neither is imported by the
# server. scripts/lib and scripts/prerender.mjs are required and re-included.
scripts/analysis
scripts/ads

# A stray 16 MB JSON in the repo root with zero references anywhere in the code.
noah.json
